                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Another solid installment of the later ND games. I really enjoyed the puzzles and the atmosphere (as always). One note, it is more puzzle-light game with lots of dialogue. The story is okay. The vagueness seems to be purposeful which is fine by me. I did not like any of the characters much. Overall, its getting 'just fine' from me.",
